## Q3: How would you make your CI/CD pipeline “AI-powered”?

**Situation:** Our Azure DevOps pipeline ran the full .NET test suite on every pull request, even for small changes, which slowed us down.

**Task:** I needed to make the pipeline faster without losing test coverage.

**Action:** I added AI-based test impact analysis to check which tests actually mattered for the changed files. I also added an LLM review step that flagged risky changes — like edits to authentication code or web.config — so they got extra review.

**Result:** Pipeline time dropped by about 40%, and the AI review step caught a bad config change before it reached production.

